+# *** 0041-N: STANDSTILL HOLD COUNTDOWN + ESCALATING DRIVER NAG (owner decision, 2026-11-05) ***
+# The clutch cannot be opened without the owner's foot (the pedal switch is the TCU input; creep-off only latches it), so
